      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fountain_City%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Fountain City post office has operated continuously since 1878, serving residents for over a century.",
